S5-07 delay_tsc entry-site RDTSC N=2 diagnostic
Date: 2026-11-16
Host: macOS/aarch64, local Codex worktree
Runner production source revision: 5fc701d00ac4abbb7f6c17eb82599d2944a6dc76 (clean)

Purpose
-------
The stride-512 poll-site trace showed differences in sampled threshold
outcomes. This diagnostic sampled every initial RDTSC at the entry to
delay_tsc, before its poll loop, to compare requested-cycle and stack
sequences in a fresh unique-nonce pair. It does not correlate an entry sample
to the poll reads within that invocation.

